Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 13:58:01 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/6] P4: CGS branding (logo, wordmark, changelog, update
 source)

Reason: The CGS build shows the CGS mark and wordmark, its own startup changelog, and must not replace itself with stock omp; none of this is reachable from the extension API.
Upstream: none (distribution-specific branding)
Remove-when: CGS stops shipping a branded omp build

- welcome logo/wordmark: CGS mark as half-block art (from assets/cgs-logo.svg)
- changelog: CHANGELOG.cgs.md replaces CHANGELOG.md for the startup changelog and /changelog
- update: the startup check and `omp update` do nothing unless PI_BUILD_URL is set
