+# Changelog
+
+CGS build of omp. Upstream's changelog is `CHANGELOG.md`; this file is what the startup changelog and `/changelog` show.
+
+## [19.1.1] - 2026-11-25
+
+### Added
+
+- CGS build: CGS logo and `cgs` wordmark on the welcome card.
+- Sign in to CGS from `/login`, with subscription channels registered by the pre-installed CGS extension.
+- `/cgs-doctor` and `/cgs-update` check and install the bundled components.
+
+### Changed
+
+- This build only updates from a CGS build service: `omp update` and the startup update check do nothing unless `PI_BUILD_URL` is set, so it is never replaced by stock omp.
+- Based on upstream omp v19.1.1 (`76b7d84`).
